origin-desktop metapackage
=========================
A metapackage installs nothing itself — it DEPENDS on things, so one
`apt install origin-desktop` pulls your whole Origin layer.

Workflow:
  1. Build your pieces (desktop, keybinds, shell) as real packages.
  2. Add each one to the Depends: list in debian/control.
  3. dpkg-buildpackage -b -us -uc
  4. Drop the .deb into debian-live/config/packages/ (see its README).
  5. Rebuild the ISO.

Set your real name/email in debian/control and debian/changelog first.
